| X1 | External probe | — | owner | `scripts/laned/accept X1 --evidence evidence/x1.json` (probe ok) |
| X2 | Harness | — | ci (fixtures) + testnet | `scripts/laned/accept X2` and, for T9, `--evidence evidence/t9.json` |
"""
# X1's own evidence verifier (LANED_EVIDENCE): a request id beyond {wp, passed}.
SELFTEST_X1_TEST = (
    "import json\nimport os\n\n\ndef test_x1_evidence():\n"
